# S11: Time-Machine Scrubber (work-control)

## Objective

Add history replay UI to work-control: scrub through chat messages, epic changes, gate events,
and task activity on a timeline. Reference: `totem/totem-view-sandbox` time scrubber pattern.

## Prerequisites

- S10 CLOSED (dogfood loop proven on todo)
- work-control WS + activity log populated (S05)

